<h1>Your subscription is active</h1>

<p>Hello <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>Your NoraCapital <strong><%= @subscription.plan.titleize %></strong> subscription is now active.</p>

<p>
  Access starts on <%= @subscription.starts_at&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") || "today" %>
  and runs until <%= @subscription.expires_at&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") || "your next billing date" %>.
</p>

<p>You can manage your account from your dashboard.</p>
